    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"sit in the dark until the screen goes black\"... that sounds so peaceful though. like, if the version of me that he loved is already gone, then what's the point of holding on to the empty shell that's left? it feels like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me.",
